<PageTitle>SpawnDev.Codecs</PageTitle>

<h1>SpawnDev.Codecs</h1>

<p>Pure-.NET, ILGPU-accelerated, patent-clean audio and video codecs. Runs on every SpawnDev.ILGPU backend (WebGPU, WebGL, Wasm, CUDA, OpenCL, CPU) so the same library works in Blazor WASM and on desktop.</p>

<h2>Current status</h2>

<h3>Audio codecs</h3>
<table>
    <thead>
        <tr><th>Codec</th><th>Decoder</th><th>Encoder</th></tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
        <tr><td>FLAC (native)</td><td>Complete</td><td>Complete (CONSTANT + FIXED + LPC, stereo decor, MD5)</td></tr>
        <tr><td>FLAC-in-Ogg</td><td>Complete</td><td>Manual via OggPageWriter</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Opus (SILK + CELT + Hybrid)</td><td>Complete via Concentus 2.2.2 backbone</td><td>Complete - mono/stereo, 8/16/24/48 kHz, 2.5/5/10/20 ms frames</td></tr>
