<h3>Transforms</h3>
<ul>
    <li>Forward MDCT + Inverse MDCT reference implementations (CPU, O(N²)).</li>
    <li>Round-trip identity <code>MDCT(IMDCT(X)) = N·X</code> validated to float precision.</li>
    <li>FFT-accelerated CPU and ILGPU-kernel variants planned.</li>
</ul>

<h3>Video codecs</h3>
<table>
    <thead>
        <tr><th>Codec</th><th>Decoder</th><th>Encoder</th></tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
        <tr><td>VP8 (RFC 6386)</td><td>Keyframe walker - ffmpeg accepts our output bit-exact through pixel level</td><td>Keyframe encoder - ffmpeg accepts at 1920x1072 (5 fps); inter frames + multi-token partition + loop filter pending</td></tr>
        <tr><td>VP9 (libvpx parity)</td><td>Keyframe walker - first 16x16 Y BIT-EXACT; multi-block via per-plane ENTROPY_CONTEXT</td><td>Keyframe encoder - ffmpeg native VP9 decodes 16x16-1920x1088 (1.5-2 fps at FullHD); inter frames + loop filter + 4:2:2/4:4:4 pending</td></tr>
        <tr><td>AV1 (libaom parity)</td><td>Keyframe walker - 6 gaps closed (scan tables, qctx, CFL alpha, directional intra, tx_type, 32/64-pt inverse DCT); pixel-mean drift pending</td><td>Keyframe encoder - libdav1d accepts 16x16 Y=128 exact; multi-block FullHD context bug pending</td></tr>
    </tbody>
</table>
<p>Patent-clean via the AOMedia patent pledge. Containers wired: IVF reader + writer, Matroska/WebM via SpawnDev.EBML, Ogg.</p>

<h3>Out of scope (patent-encumbered)</h3>
<p>H.264, H.265, AAC, MP3 — delegated to platform encoders via <code>SpawnDev.MultiMedia</code>.</p>

